WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
1. Open Contact best fit and set the brush

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
2. Paint the first moving patch

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
3. Paint the matching target patch

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000
4. Add two independent regions and review the fit

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.042
Motion replay: seat the three matching contact regions.

00:00:14.042 --> 00:00:17.042
5. Fit, inspect, and save
